@startuml
!include ../../../tools/diagrams/kcna-theme.puml
left to right direction
title Monolithic architecture — everything bound to everything

rectangle "Web server\n<size:11>Apache HTTP Server</size>\n<size:11>or NGINX</size>" <<muted>> as ws
rectangle "Runtime\n<size:11>PHP or Java</size>" <<muted>> as rt
rectangle "Monolith — one deployable unit" <<groupBad>> as mono {
  rectangle "User\nInterface" as ui
  rectangle "Business\nLogic" as bl
  rectangle "Data\nInterface" as di
  ui -[#DC2626]-> bl
  bl -[#DC2626]-> di
}
rectangle "ODBC driver\n<size:11>Open Database</size>\n<size:11>Connectivity</size>" <<muted>> as odbc
database "Database" as db

ws -[#DC2626]-> rt
rt -[#DC2626]-> ui
di -[#DC2626]-> odbc
odbc -[#DC2626]-> db

caption <i>Every red link is a tight coupling. A change to one piece — a library version, the runtime, the web server, the driver, the schema —</i>\n<i>can ripple into every other piece, so the whole unit is rebuilt, retested and redeployed together.</i>
@enduml
